  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……\r\n逆にちょっとうるさくなっちゃうかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もともと智代子は毎日投稿してくれてるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ですよね……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──とすると、必要な時は日常系の投稿を\r\nソロ曲の告知に変える感じでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いつもは写真をつけてますけど、\r\n告知の時は意識的に動画を増やして、手厚くする方向で──",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、メインはそうなるな\r\nあとは要所要所で生配信とか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "感想大会みたいなのもできるといいかもしれない\r\n初めてのソロ曲なのはファンの人たちも同じだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "確かにです……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、情報解禁後の運用はそんな感じでいこう\r\n次だけど、撮りたい動画のイメージはあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "意気込みを伝えられるようなものは\r\nあるといいなと思っていて……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "他のインタビューとかもあるかもなんですけど……\r\nこういう機会なので、自分の声でも届けられたらって",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "了解だ\r\nいいと思うぞ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015010090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──……ちなみになんですが、\r\nソロ曲の衣装を着て撮れたりしますか……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001501/2010015010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あー、なるほど……！？\r\nちょっと待ってな──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
